#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/method-resolution-conflicts.md:6
msgid "Method Resolution Conflicts"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/method-resolution-conflicts.md:8
msgid ""
"What happens when you have a name conflict between an inherent method and an "
"extension method?"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/method-resolution-conflicts.md:12
msgid "// Copyright 2025 Google LLC\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/idiomatic/leveraging-the-type-system/extension-traits/method-resolution-conflicts.md:13
